  "description": "Adventure Optimized\n\nYour Year-Round Adventure Rig\n\nAny Terrain, from urban jungle to Iceland's harshest winter crossings. Explorer Peak's 27.5x4.5” wheels and tires roll fast and capably over loose and soft terrain and have maximum traction on hard or rocky trails.\n\nTackle Whatever Mother Nature Throws at You\n\nThe Explorer Peak full-carbon frame is light, strong, and backed with our Lifetime Warranty. Full power pedal-assist allows you to get the torque you need immediately on those tricky segments of the trail.\n\nGet to the Places Most People Only Dream of\n\nUnlock the ability to go over any landscape anywhere with Explorer Peak's progressive frame geometry. A stable 67-degree head tube angle enhances control, while the comfortable 75-degree seat tube angle ensures powerful and efficient pedaling. The low standover height accommodates riders of all sizes and allows for longer dropper seat posts.\n\nIntelligent Power Management\n\nRide with precision using the latest Shimano drive units. The Explorer Peak offers custom motor tuning profiles, including \"Soft Terrain Mode\" and \"Hard Terrain Mode,\" allowing you to fine-tune power output to match specific terrains and situations.",
